// ── :domain:* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
// The business heart of the application.
// Pure Kotlin — zero imports from Android, Ktor, Room, or Compose.
// Defines WHAT the system does (UseCases), WHAT it works with
// (entities), and WHAT it needs (repository interfaces).
// This layer never changes when you switch databases or APIs.
//
// Internal structure (same pattern for every :domain:* module):
//   model/
//     Xxx.kt                    → domain entity (plain Kotlin data class)
//   repository/
//     XxxRepository.kt          → interface (contract for :data:* to implement)
//   usecase/
//     XxxUseCase.kt             → single-responsibility business operation
//   exception/
//     XxxException.kt           → domain-specific error types
//
// Depends on  : :core:common only
// Must NOT import : :data:*, :core:network, :core:database, :feature:*